    {
      "number": 1,
      "stem": "You accidentally spill water on another person's bag. Say, \"____\"",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "You are welcome."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "I am sorry."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Good luck."
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "Well done."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "A：回应感谢，不是道歉。；B：为刚发生的过失道歉。；C：祝好运，不是道歉。；D：称赞成就，不是道歉。"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "stem": "To see how much the fruit costs per kilogram, read the ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "bus map"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "story title"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "weather chart"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "price label"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "rationale": "A：公交图不说明水果单价。；B：故事标题不说明水果单价。；C：天气图不说明水果单价。；D：价签说明每千克的价格。"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "This shopping bag is ____ than the one I carried yesterday.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "heavier"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "heavy"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "heaviest"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "more heavier"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A：than前用比较级heavier。；B：heavy为原级。；C：heaviest为最高级。；D：more与heavier重复比较。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "stem": "The stall opens at nine. We arrived at 8:40, twenty minutes ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "nearly"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "recently"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "early"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "loudly"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "A：nearly不作此minutes后的时间差补语。；B：recently表示最近，不表达提前二十分钟。；C：比开摊提前二十分钟。；D：loudly表示大声的方式。"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "stem": "I was choosing apples when the rain started. Ask about the activity: ____ were you doing ____ the rain started?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Where, what"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "When, what"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "What, who"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "What, when"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "rationale": "A：Where不询问活动，what不能连接此从句。；B：When不问活动，第二空what不适合此从句。；C：who不能在the rain主语前作时间连词。；D：What询问选择苹果这项活动，when连接下雨时刻。"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "stem": "The fruit shop opens ____ eight every Sunday.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "in"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "at"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "on"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "behind"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "A：in不用于此钟点。；B：钟点前用at。；C：on不用于此钟点。；D：behind表示空间位置，不是此时间关系。"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "stem": "The three sellers ____ the boxes when I arrived yesterday.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "were moving"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "was moving"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "is moving"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "am moving"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A：复数sellers和过去语境与were moving一致。；B：was不与复数主语一致。；C：is不与复数主语及过去语境一致。；D：am只与I一致。"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "stem": "The green melon is much ____ than the small pear.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "big"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "biggest"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "bigger"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "more bigger"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "A：big是原级。；B：biggest为最高级。；C：much与比较级bigger及than相配。；D：more与bigger重复。"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "stem": "This bag is light ____ for me to carry with one hand.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "much"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "enough"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "many"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "most"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "A：much不在light后构成此结构。；B：light enough to carry表示轻到足以提起。；C：many不用于此结构。；D：most不用于此结构。"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "stem": "This is ____ basket on the shelf.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "cheapest"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "cheaper"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "cheap"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "the cheapest"
